"""
dashboard_style.py

Styling helpers for the Lead Scrapper Tool — warm cream backdrop,
orange accent, dark-brown text (Kunash Media CRM look).

Same public API as before:
    inject_css(), sidebar_brand(), sidebar_nav(), topbar(),
    icon_stat_card(), panel
Usage (matches the reference screenshot):
    icon_stat_card("Total Leads Collected", 1246, "All-time records", icon="users",    tone="orange")
    icon_stat_card("Leads Today",           100,  "of 200 daily limit", icon="calendar", tone="red")
    icon_stat_card("Daily Limit",           200,  "companies per day",  icon="building", tone="amber")
    icon_stat_card("Searches Left Today",   2,    "of 4 allowed",       icon="plus",     tone="green")
New helpers:
    svg_icon(name)   -> inline SVG for icon_stat_card(icon=...)
    style_fig(fig)   -> applies the theme to a Plotly figure
"""

